{"title":"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/7/d278803d72fcc493afb1559174a483aa7f41d143.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> grid is filled with integers (positive or negative) such that the product of the integers\nin any row or column is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. For example, one possible grid is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d822912cb10b90472a01b20d4031485b0919403d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{bmatrix}    1 &amp; -5&amp; -4 \\\\     10  &amp; -2 &amp;-1 \\\\    2&amp; 2&amp; 5 \\end{bmatrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"116\" height=\"64\" />\n</p><p>In how many ways can this be done?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO\" title=\"2015 UMO\">2015 UMO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UMO Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.utmath.org/home\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Utah_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"Utah Math Olympiad\"> All UMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018000628\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplicati